                                "sense_id": "acd36bf5-160f-3d19-91f0-5979e06e818f",
                                "text": "In a device of the kind described, a plurality of platforms normally horizontally disposed in staired arrangement, each of said platforms comprising a pair of elongated platform elements[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "795d472b-9379-48b7-8de1-fd4b249106dd",
                                "sense_id": "acd36bf5-160f-3d19-91f0-5979e06e818f",
                                "text": "They are variously described as simple, compound, hanging, tandem or two-staired, intersecting and nivation cirques."
                            },
                            {
