                                "sense_id": "acd36bf5-160f-3d19-91f0-5979e06e818f",
                                "text": "There is also speculation that the name Galata comes from the Italian word for descent (calata), an appropriate description of the steep and staired streets that slope down the hill from Beyoglu to the Golden Horn."
                            }
